{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a casual card game with a playtime of about 1\u20133 hours, featuring 4 main chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff0d\uff0d\uff0d\uff0d\uff0d\uff0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a land far, far away.<br>Once a mighty kingdom, it has fallen into decline due to political strife. Hidden monsters are stirring, and the people are suffering in despair.<br>Until the arrival of three priests \u2014 chosen to carry out the will of the Goddess and save the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Players can choose one of the characters to challenge various stages scattered across the kingdom. By clearing specific stages, they can recruit new followers and obtain new cards (Contracts), building an even stronger deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ac8383e7f93f481941dc641b88c8a67e.poster.avif?t=1758876657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ac8383e7f93f481941dc641b88c8a67e.webm?t=1758876657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ac8383e7f93f481941dc641b88c8a67e.mp4?t=1758876657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Release Contract]</strong> Spend Action Points to play a card, dealing damage to enemies or gaining powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/6a45e572929fa1c578ff546378f2214b.poster.avif?t=1758876657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/6a45e572929fa1c578ff546378f2214b.webm?t=1758876657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/6a45e572929fa1c578ff546378f2214b.mp4?t=1758876657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Devour Contract]</strong> Discard a card to gain Action Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/b217c2ee4dd90c34d87cba3bb715ad57.poster.avif?t=1758876657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/b217c2ee4dd90c34d87cba3bb715ad57.webm?t=1758876657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/b217c2ee4dd90c34d87cba3bb715ad57.mp4?t=1758876657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering when to release or devour contracts will be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978700?t=1758876657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978700?t=1758876657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/58c88a685389fad754380088fb19b8c58dab7e35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758876657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/58c88a685389fad754380088fb19b8c58dab7e35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758876657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2